    "category": "Gable Mount, Plug-In, 3-Speed ECM",
    "badge": "Best Overall",
    "amazonUrl": "#",
    "rating": 4.3,
    "reviewCount": 600,
    "pros": [
      "3-speed ECM motor rated 2,801 / 2,041 / 1,337 CFM at about 142 / 73 / 23 watts",
      "QuietCool also publishes HVI-916 airflow with a standard louver: 1,400 / 1,000 / 620 CFM",
