          <a href="#do-you-need-one" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">1. Do You Need One?</a>
          <a href="#how-we-picked" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">2. How We Picked</a>
          <a href="#top-picks" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">3. Our 6 Top Picks</a>
