          <a href="#sizing" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">5. CFM vs Attic Size</a>
          <a href="#intake" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">6. Intake Net Free Area</a>
          <a href="#controls" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">7. Thermostats and Humidistats</a>
